      "extract": "Let n(x) = (n1(x), n2(x), n3(x)) be a unit three vector of scalar ﬁelds with a constraint n · n = 1. The Lagrangian of our model is given by (µ = 0, 1, 2, 3) L = 1 2∂µn · ∂µn −L4(n) −V (n). (1) Here, the four-derivative (Faddeev-Skyrme) term is given by L4(n) = κF 2 µν = κ [n · (∂µn × ∂νn)]2 = κ(∂µn × ∂νn)2 (2) with a “ﬁeld strength,” Fµν = n · (∂µn × ∂νn). (3) We take the potential term [16, 22] V (n) = m2(1 −n2",
